  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved protection of relief personnel and improved  effectiveness of humanitarian action Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian organisations in Mozambique have access to timely, 
reliable, and high-quality safety services that help them plan, operate, 
and deliver aid more safely. 
Result 1: Information, Analysis and Advice &#x2013; NGOs are provided with 
objective, credible, reliable, and high-quality security information 
analysis, and advice in a timely and appropriate manner.
Result 2: Security Management, Preparedness and Capacity 
Development &#x2013; NGOs are supported in developing their security and 
crisis management preparedness and capacity through direct support 
and training.</narrative>
  </description>
